  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PacificAus Sports</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This program seeks to improve outcomes for high-performance women&#x2019;s sports in the Pacific. The program is working towards three outcomes: 
1) Administration of Pacific sport organisations strengthened to improve women&#x2019;s high-performance pathways in sport, 
2) Women interests in sport are effectively represented through the leadership and strategic direction of Pacific sports organisations, and 
3) Inclusive sports competitions provide pathways for women to pursue careers in high performance sport.</narrative>
  </description>
